hadiths[42]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Amir-ul-mu'minin Abi Hafs 'Umar bin al-Khattab radiyallahu 'anhu farmate hain: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: ""Aamaal ka daromadar niyaton par hai, aur har shakhs ke liye wahi hai jiski usne niyat ki. To jiski hijrat Allah aur uske Rasool ki taraf ho, to uski hijrat Allah aur uske Rasool ki taraf hai, aur jiski hijrat kisi duniya ki taraf ho jise use haasil karna ho, ya kisi aurat ki taraf ho jis se usne nikaah kiya ho, to uski hijrat usi cheez ki taraf hai jis ki taraf usne hijrat ki."" Yeh imam-ul-muhaddithin Abu 'Abdullah Muhammad bin Isma'il bin Ibrahim bin al-Mughira bin Bardizbah al-Bukhari al-Ju'fi [raqam: 1], aur Abu al-Husain Muslim bin al-Hajjaj bin Muslim al-Qushairi al-Naisaburi [raqam: 1907] radiyallahu 'anhuma ne apne ""Saheehain"" mein riwayat kiya hai jo tameer ki gayi kitabon mein sab se asahh hain."
"2","[AI-translation] Aur 'Umar radiyallahu 'anhu farmate hain: Ek roz jab hum Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ke paas baithhe hue the, achanak hamare paas ek aadmi tashreef laya jis ke kapde safed aur baal kaale the, na safar ka asar un par zahir tha aur na hi koi hum mein se unhe pehchaanta tha. Yahan tak ke Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ke paas aakar baith gaye. Apne ghutne un ke ghutnon se laga diye, aur apne haath un ke ranon par rakh diye, aur kaha: ""E Muhammad! Mujhe Islam ki khabar de."" Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: ""Islam yeh hai ke tu gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin aur Muhammad Rasoolullah hain, aur namaz qaim kare, aur zakat de, aur Ramadan ka roza rakhe, aur Baitullah ka haj kare agar us tak pohanchni ka rasta ho."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tum ne sach kaha."" Hum ko ta'ajjub hua ke woh poochte hain aur tasdeeq karte hain! Unhon ne kaha: ""To mujhe iman ki khabar de."" Farmaya: ""Ke tu Allah par, uske farishton par, uski kitabon par, uske paigambaron par, aur qayamat ke din par iman laye, aur achhi aur buri taqdeer par iman laye."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tum ne sach kaha."" Unhon ne kaha: ""To mujhe ihsaan ki khabar de."" Farmaya: ""Ke tu Allah ki ibadat aise kare goya tu use dekh raha hai, agar tu use nahin dekh raha to woh tujhe dekh raha hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""To mujhe qayamat ke bare mein khabar de."" Farmaya: ""Poochne wale ko is baare mein zyada nahin maloom jo pooch raha hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""To mujhe us ki nishaaniyon ki khabar de?"" Farmaya: ""Ke kanizi apne aqa ko paida kare, aur tum dekho ke nange paon, nange badan, majboor beedariyon ko bade-bade makan banana mein barabar karte hain."" Phir woh chaley gaye, aur main kafi der thahra. Phir farmaya: ""E 'Umar! Kya tum jaante ho poochne wala kaun hai?"" Maine kaha: ""Allah aur uska Rasool behtar jaante hain."" Farmaya: ""Woh Jibreel hain, tumhare paas tumhara deen sikhane aaye hain."" [Muslim ne riwayat ki]."
"3","[AI-translation] Abu 'Abd-ur-Rahman 'Abdullah bin 'Umar bin al-Khattab radiyallahu 'anhuma farmate hain: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: ""Islam paanch cheezon par bana hai: Is ki gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin aur Muhammad Rasoolullah hain, namaz qaim karna, zakat dena, Baitullah ka haj karna, aur Ramadan ke roze rakhna."" [Bukhari ne riwayat ki], [aur Muslim ne]."
"4","[AI-translation] Abu Abdir-Rahman Abdullah bin Mas'ud radiyallahu 'anhu se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne - jo sache hain aur jinhein sachi khabar di gayi hai - khabar di: ""Beshak tum mein se kisi ek ki khalqat us ki maa ke pait mein chale din nutfah ki soorat mein jama hoti hai, phir utni hi muddat 'alaqah banti hai, phir utni hi muddat mudghah banti hai, phir us ke paas farishta bheja jata hai to woh us mein roh phoonkta hai, aur char baaton ke hukm se: us ka rizq likhna, us ki ajal, us ke amal, aur kya woh shaki hai ya sa'eed. Pas us Allah ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mab'ood nahi, tum mein se ek shakhs ahl-e-jannat ke amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur jannat ke darmiyan sirf ek baazoo ki doori reh jati hai, phir us par taqdeer ghalib aa jati hai to woh ahl-e-nar ke amal karta hai aur jahannam mein dakhil ho jata hai. Aur beshak tum mein se ek shakhs ahl-e-nar ke amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur jahannam ke darmiyan sirf ek baazoo ki doori reh jati hai, phir us par taqdeer ghalib aa jati hai to woh ahl-e-jannat ke amal karta hai aur jannat mein dakhil ho jata hai."" [Isay Al-Bukhari ne riwayat kiya], [aur Muslim ne]."
"5","[AI-translation] Umm-ul-Mu'minin Umm 'Abdillah 'Aishah radiyallahu 'anha se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: ""Jo shakhs hamare is amr mein koi aisi cheez ijad kare jo is mein se nahi hai, to woh rad hai."" [Isay Al-Bukhari ne riwayat kiya], [aur Muslim ne]. Aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai: ""Jo koi aisa amal kare jo hamare amr par nahi hai, to woh rad hai."
"6","[AI-translation] Abu 'Abdillah An-Nu'man bin Bashir (Radi Allahu 'anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhonne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Beshak halal wazeh hai, aur beshak haram wazeh hai, aur in dono ke darmiyan aisi mushabhihat (shubha wali) cheezein hain jinhein kai log nahi jante. Pas jisne shubhat se bacha, to usne apne deen aur izzat ki barah'een (hifazat) kar li, aur jo shubhat mein padh gaya, wo haram mein gir gaya, jaise charwah jo (badshah ke) mehwar ke gird chara raha, woh qareeb hai ke andar chala jaye. Aagah ho! Beshak har badshah ka ek mehwar hota hai, aagah ho! Beshak Allah ka mehwar uski muharramaat hain. Aagah ho! Beshak jism mein ek mughza (goshth ka loh) hai jab wo saleem ho to poora jism saleem ho jata hai aur jab wo fasid ho to poora jism fasid ho jata hai. Aagah ho! Wo qalb (dil) hai."" [Isay Bukhari aur Muslim ne riwayat kiya.]"
"7","[AI-translation] Abu Ruqayyah Tamim bin Aws ad-Dari (Radi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Deen nasihat hai."" Hum ne pucha: ""Kis ke liye?"" Farmaya: ""Allah ke liye, aur uski Kitaab ke liye, aur uske Rasool ke liye, aur musalmano ke a'immah aur unki 'aamat (ummi logo) ke liye."" [Isay Muslim ne riwayat kiya.]"
"8","[AI-translation] Ibn 'Umar (Radi Allahu 'anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logo se muqaabla (larkan) karun yahan tak ke wo yeh gawahi den ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad (Sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) Allah ke Rasool hain, aur namaaz qaaim karein aur zakaat adaa karein; pas jab wo yeh kar lenge to unka khoon aur maal mere siwa mehfooz ho jayega illa bahaqq-e-Islaam, aur unka hisaab Allah Ta'ala par hai."" [Isay Bukhari aur Muslim ne riwayat kiya.]"
"9","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah 'Abd-ur-Rahman bin Sakhr (Radi Allahu 'anhu) kehte hain: Maine Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jis cheez se main tumhein roka ho usse door raho, aur jis cheez ka main ne tumhein hukm diya ho us mein se jitna ho sake aamaal karo. Beshak tum se pehle logo ki tabahi unke sawalaat ki kathrat aur apne anbiya se ikhtilaaf ki wajah se hui."" [Isay Bukhari aur Muslim ne riwayat kiya.]"
"10","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Radi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah taayyib (paak) hai aur sirf taayyib ko qubool karta hai, aur beshak Allah ne mu'mineen ko wahi hukm diya jo mursaleen ko diya, pas farmaya: 'Aye rasool! Taayyibaat (paak cheezein) khao aur saaleh amal karo', aur farmaya: 'Aye imaan walo! Un taayyibaat mein se khao jo humne tumhein rizq mein di hain'. Phir aap (Sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne us shakhs ka zikr kiya jo safar mein lamba karte hain, ash'ath (baal parit) aghbar (dhool mitti se aabla), apne haath aasman ki taraf barhata hai (kehta hai): Ya Rab! Ya Rab! Halanke uska khana haraam hai, peena haraam hai, kapde haraam hain aur haraam se paalaa gaya hai, phir uski (dua) kaise qubool hogi?"" [Isay Muslim ne riwayat kiya.]"
"11","[AI-translation] Abu Muhammad Hasan bin Ali bin Abi Talib, nawase Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam wa rayhanatih, radiyallahu anhuma, farmate hain: Main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se yaad rakha: ""Jo cheez tumhein shak mein daal de usey chhod do us cheez ki taraf jo shak mein na daale"". Isay Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya [raqam: 2520], [aur Nasai ne] aur Tirmidhi ne farmaya: Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai."
"12","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radiyallahu anhu farmate hain: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: ""Insaan ke Islam ki husn mein se yeh hai ke wo usay chhod de jo us se muta'alliq nahi"". Yeh hadith hasan hai, isay Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya [raqam: 2318], Ibn Majah ne [raqam: 3976]."
"13","[AI-translation] Abu Hamzah Anas bin Malik radiyallahu anhu, khadim-e Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi shakhs tab tak momin nahi hoga jab tak ke wo apne bhai ke liye wo pasand na kare jo apne liye pasand karta hai"". Isay Bukhari ne riwayat kiya [raqam: 13], aur Muslim ne [raqam: 45]. [Isay Bukhari ne riwayat kiya], [aur Muslim ne]."
"14","[AI-translation] Ibn Mas'ud radiyallahu anhu farmate hain: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: ""Kisi musalman [jo yeh gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka rasool hoon] ka khoon haram hai siwaye teen cheezon ke: Shadi shuda zani karne wala, Jaan badle jaan, aur deen chhodne wala jamaat se alag hone wala"". [Isay Bukhari ne riwayat kiya], [aur Muslim ne]."
"15","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radiyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: ""Jo Allah aur roz-e-akhirat par iman rakhta hai wo acchi baat kahe ya khamosh rahe, jo Allah aur roz-e-akhirat par iman rakhta hai wo apne hamsaye ki izzat kare, aur jo Allah aur roz-e-akhirat par iman rakhta hai wo apne mehman ki izzat kare"". [Isay Bukhari ne riwayat kiya], [aur Muslim ne]."
"16","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah radiyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha: Mujhe wasiyat kijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Gussa na karo. Us ne baar baar (yahi) kaha, Aap ne farmaya: Gussa na karo. [Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai.]"
"17","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ya'la Shaddad bin Aws radiyallahu anhu se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki riwayat hai ke unhone farmaya: Allah ta'ala ne har cheez par ihsan likh diya hai. Pas jab tum (kisi ko) qatal karo to qatal ko achay tarike se karo, aur jab zibh karo to zibh ko achay tarike se karo, aur tum mein se har ek apna chaku tez kar le aur zibh hone wali cheez ko aaram de. [Muslim ne riwayat kiya hai.]"
"18","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zar Jundab bin Junadah aur Hazrat Abu Abd-ur-Rahman Mu'az bin Jabal radiyallahu anhuma se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki riwayat hai ke unhone farmaya: Jahan bhi ho Allah se daro, aur buraai ke baad neki karo, woh usey mita degi, aur logon ke sath achay akhlaq se pesh aao. Isay Tirmizi ne riwayat kiya hai [raqam:1987] aur farmaya: Yeh hadith hasan hai, aur kuch nuskho mein: hasan sahih hai."
"19","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas radiyallahu anhuma farmate hain ke main ek din Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peeche tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae ladke! Main tumhein kuch kalimaat sikhata hoon: Allah ki hifazat karo, woh tumhari hifazat karega. Allah ki hifazat karo, tumhein apne saamne paoge. Jab maango to Allah se maango, aur jab madad chaho to Allah se madad maango, aur jaan lo ke agar tamam ummat mil kar bhi tumhein kisi cheez ka nafa pahunchana chahe to woh tumhein kisi cheez se nafa nahi pahunchayengi magar us cheez se jo Allah ne tumhare liye likh di ho. Aur agar woh mil kar tumhein kisi cheez ka nuqsaan pahunchana chahein to tumhein kisi cheez se nuqsaan nahi pahunchayenge magar us cheez se jo Allah ne tumhare upar likh di ho. Qalam utha li gayin aur sahaifein khushk ho gayin. Isay Tirmizi ne riwayat kiya hai [raqam:2516] aur farmaya: Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai. Aur ghair Tirmizi riwayat mein hai: ""Allah ki hifazat karo, tumhein apne aage paoge. Aasani mein Allah ko pehchano to woh mushkil mein tumhein pehchanega. Aur jaan lo ke jo tumhein miss ho gayi woh tumhein kabhi nahi mil sakti, aur jo tumhein mil gayi woh tum se miss nahi ho sakti. Aur jaan lo ke fatah sabr ke saath hai, aur faraj karb ke saath hai, aur mushkil ke saath aasani hai."
"20","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud Uqbah bin Amr Al-Ansari Al-Badri radiyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli nubuwwat ke aqwal mein se jo baat logon tak pohanchi hai us mein se yeh hai: Agar tujhe sharam nahi hai to jo chahe kar le. [Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai.]"
"21","[AI-translation] Abu Amr, aur kaha gaya Abu Amra, Sufyan bin Abdullah Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine kaha: Ya Rasool Allah! Mujhe Islam ke baray mein aisa qaul farmayein ke main is ke baray mein aap ke siwa kisi aur se na poochun. Aap Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kaho: Aaman tu billahi summa istaqim. [Rawahu Muslim]."
"22","[AI-translation] Abu Abdullah Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari Razi Allahu Anhuma se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se poocha aur kaha: Dekhiye agar main farz namazein padhun, Ramazan ke roze rakhoon, halal ko halal kar doon, haram ko haram kar doon, aur is ke baray mein kuch izafa na karoon, to kya main jannat mein dakhil hoo ga? Farmaya: Haan. [Rawahu Muslim]."
"23","[AI-translation] Abu Malik Al-Harith bin Aasim Al-Ash'ari Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Tahoor (paaki) iman ka nisf hai, aur Alhamdulillah mizan ko bhar deta hai, aur Subhan Allah wa Alhamdulillah aasman o zameen ke darmiyan ko bhar deta hai -ya: bhar deta hai-, aur namaz noor hai, aur sadqa burhan (daleel) hai, aur sabr diya (roshni) hai, aur Quran aap ke liye hujjat hai ya aap par. Har shakhs subah ko (apne kaam par) nikalta hai, to apni jaan bechta hai, ya to usey azaad karta hai ya halaak karta hai. [Rawahu Muslim]."
"24","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr Ghifari Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se, jo kuch wo apne Rabb Tabarak wa Ta'ala se riwayat karte hain, ke Allah ne farmaya: Aye bandon! Main ne zulm ko apni zaat par haram kiya hai, aur usey tumhare darmiyan haram muqarrar kiya hai; pas ek doosre par zulm na karo. Aye bandon! Tum sab gumrah ho magar jise main ne hidayat di ho, pas mujh se hidayat talab karo, main tumhein hidayat doonga. Aye bandon! Tum sab bhookhe ho magar jise main ne khilaya ho, pas mujh se khana talab karo, main tumhein khilaonga. Aye bandon! Tum sab nanga ho magar jise main ne kapda pehnaya ho, pas mujh se kapda talab karo, main tumhein kapda pehnaonga. Aye bandon! Tum raat din khatai (gunah) karte ho, aur main tamam gunah maaf karta hoon; pas mujh se maghfirat talab karo, main tumhein maaf kar doonga. Aye bandon! Tum hargiz mere nuqsan ko nahi pohonch sakte ke mujhe nuqsan pohonchao, aur hargiz mere nafa ko nahi pohonch sakte ke mujhe nafa pohonchao. Aye bandon! Agar tumhare awwaleen, aakhireen, insaan aur jinn, tum mein se kisi ek shakhs ke sab se zyada muttaqi dil ke barabar ho jayein, to is se meri saltanat mein kuch izafa nahi hoga. Aye bandon! Agar tumhare awwaleen, aakhireen, insaan aur jinn, tum mein se kisi ek shakhs ke sab se zyada faajir dil ke barabar ho jayein, to is se meri saltanat mein kuch kami nahi hogi. Aye bandon! Agar tumhare awwaleen, aakhireen, insaan aur jinn sab ek sa'id (sahra) par khade ho jayein, phir mujh se maangen, aur main har ek ko uski maang de doon, to jo mere paas hai us mein se is tarah kam nahi hoga jis tarah samandar mein soii (sui) utarne se (pani) kam hota hai. Aye bandon! Yeh sirf tumhare aamaal hain jo main tumhare liye likh rakhta hoon, phir tumhein unka poora badla doonga; pas jise khair mile, to Allah ka shukar kare, aur jise is ke siwa kuch mile, to apni jaan ke siwa kisi ko malamat na kare. [Rawahu Muslim]."
"25","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr Razi Allahu Anhu se bhi riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke kuch as-haab ne Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se kaha: Ya Rasool Allah! Maaldaron ne to ajr le liya; wo isi tarah namaz parhte hain jaisay hum parhte hain, aur isi tarah roze rakhte hain jaisay hum rakhte hain, aur apne maal ke fazool (ziyada) se sadqa karte hain. Aap Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: Kya Allah ne tumhein wo cheez nahi muqarrar ki jis se tum sadqa karo? Beshak har tasbeeh sadqa hai, aur har takbeer sadqa hai, aur har tahmeed sadqa hai, aur har tahleel sadqa hai, aur amr bil maroof sadqa hai, aur nahi anil munkar sadqa hai, aur tum mein se har ek ke bu'd (jima) mein sadqa hai. Sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah! Kya ham mein se koi apni shahwat (jima) poora karta hai aur us mein us ke liye ajr bhi hoga? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne nahi dekha agar wo isko (apne maniy ko) haram mein dale, to kya us par wizar (gunah ka bojh) hota? To isi tarah jab wo usey halal mein dale, to us ke liye ajr hoga. [Rawahu Muslim]."
"26","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radiyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har insan ke har jore par sadqa hai. Har din jis mein sooraj nikalta hai, usmein do shakhs ke darmiyan insaaf karna sadqa hai, aur kisi mard ki sawari mein uski madad karna ke usko sawar karna ya uska samaan oopar uthana sadqa hai, aur achhi baat sadqa hai, aur namaz ki taraf utha har qadam sadqa hai, aur raaste se takleef dah cheez ko hataana sadqa hai. [Bukhari ne riwayat kiya] [aur Muslim]."
"27","[AI-translation] Nawwas bin Sam'an radiyallahu anhu se Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat hai, aapne farmaya: Neiki aakhlaq ka haseen hai, aur gunah woh hai jo teray seene mein khalal dale aur jis par logon ka jaanna tu na-pasand kare. [Muslim ne riwayat kiya]. Aur Wabisah bin Ma'bad radiyallahu anhu riwayat karte hain ke unhone kaha: Main Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya to aapne farmaya: Kya tum neki ke baare mein poochne aaye ho? Maine kaha: Haan. To farmaya: Apne dil se fatwa maango, neki woh hai jis par nafs mutma'in ho aur dil us par mutma'in ho, aur gunah woh hai jo nafs mein khalal dale aur seene mein hichole, agarche log tumhein fatwa dein. Yeh hadith hasan hai, humne ise Imamain Ahmad bin Hanbal [raqm: 4/227] aur Darimi [2/246] ke musnado mein hasan isnad se riwayat kiya hai."
"28","[AI-translation] Abu Nujaih Al-Irbad bin Sariyah radiyallahu anhu kehte hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne hamein aisi nasihat ki jis se darr ke maare dil thikrane lage aur aankhein bhar aayen, hum ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Yeh aisi nasihat hai jaisi koi vida kiya karta ho, hamein wasiyat farma dijiye. Aapne farmaya: Main tumhein Allah ki taqwa aur sunnat aur ita'at ki wasiyat karta hoon, agarche tumhare muqable mein ek ghulaam bhi hukmaran ban jaye. Tum mein se jo zinda rahega woh bohot ikhtilaaf dekhega. To tumhari mera sunnat aur rashid mahdi khulafa ki sunnat hai, ise danto se mazbooti se pakro, aur naye masail se bacho, kyunke har biddat gumrahi hai. [Abu Dawood ne riwayat kiya] aur Tirmidhi [raqm: 266] ne kaha: Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai."
"29","[AI-translation] Mu'az bin Jabal radiyallahu anhu riwayat karte hain ke unhone kaha: Maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Mujhe aisa amal bataiye jo mujhe jannat mein daakhil kare aur jahannam se door kare. Aapne farmaya: Tum ne ek azeem cheez ke baare mein poocha hai, aur woh us par aasaan hai jise Allah us par aasaan kar de: Allah ki ibaadat karo uska koi shareek na banao, namaz qaim karo, zakaat do, Ramazaan ke roze rakho, aur Bait ka hajj karo. Phir farmaya: Kya main tumhein khair ke darwazo ki taraf na daloon? Roza dhaal hai, sadqa gunah ko is tarah bujha deta hai jaise paani aag ko bujha deta hai, aur raat ke andhere mein aadmi ki namaz. Phir aapne padha: ""Tatajafa junubuhum anil madaji"" yahan tak ke ""Ya'maloon"" [Surah As-Sajdah, Aayaat 16 aur 17]. Phir farmaya: Kya main tumhein maamle ke sar aur uske sutun aur uski oonchi choti ki khabar na doon? Maine kaha: Balke Ya Rasoolallah. Farmaya: Maamle ka sar Islam hai, uska sutun namaz hai aur uski oonchi choti jihad hai. Phir farmaya: Kya main tumhein in sab ki mabda na bataon? Maine kaha: Balke Ya Rasoolallah! To aapne apni zubaan pakar li aur farmaya: Ise rok kar rakho. Maine kaha: Ya Nabi Allah! Kya hum us baat ke waaste pakre jayenge jo hum bolte hain? Farmaya: Teri maa tujhe gham mein khoya kare, kya logon ko unke muh ke bal giraya jayega, ya farmaya unki naako ke bal, magar unki zubaano ki kaati hui fasal ke siwa? Ise Tirmidhi [raqm: 2616] ne riwayat kiya aur kaha: Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai."
"30","[AI-translation] Abu Tha'labah Al-Khushani Jurthum bin Nashir radiyallahu anhu se Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se riwayat hai ke aapne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne kuch faraiz muqarrar kiye to unhein zaya na karo, aur kuch hudood muqarrar kiye to un mein tajawuz na karo, aur kuch cheezein haraam ki hain to unhein haqar na karo, aur kuch cheezon ke baare mein apni rehmat se tumhare liye chup raha, na ke bhoole hoon, to unki talash na karo. Yeh hadith hasan hai, ise Dar Qutni ne apni Sunan mein [4/184] aur ghair ne riwayat kiya."
"31","[AI-translation] Abu al-Abbas Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi raziallahu anhu riwayat karte hain ke unhone kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aakar kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Mujhe aisi amal ki taraf raahnamaai farma'iye jab main isey karoon to Allah mujhe muhabat farmaye aur log bhi mujhe muhabat karein. Aapne farmaya: Duniya se zahid ho jao, Allah tum se muhabat karega, aur logo ke paas jo hai us se zahid ho jao, log tum se muhabat karenge. Hadith hasan, isey Ibn Majah [raqam: 4102] aur ghair ne husn isnaad se riwayat kiya hai."
"32","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Sa'd bin Malik bin Sinan al-Khudri raziallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Na zarar hai na zarar pahunchana. Hadith hasan, isey Ibn Majah [raje raqam:2341], al-Daraqutni [raqam:4/228], aur ghair ne musnad tor par riwayat kiya. Aur Malik [2/746] ne ""Muwatta"" mein Amr bin Yahya ke zariye apne waalid se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se mursalan riwayat kiya, jis mein Abu Sa'id ko hata diya, aur iske raaste hain jo ek dusre ko taqwiyat dete hain."
"33","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas raziallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar logon ko unke daaway par de diya jaye to kuch log dusray qaum ke maal aur khoon ka daawa karte, lekin bayyinah muddai par hai aur yameen munkir par hai. Hadith hasan, isey al-Bayhaqi ne [""Sunan"" mein 10/252] aur ghair ne aise hi riwayat kiya, aur iska baaz hissa ""Sahihain"" mein hai."
"34","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id al-Khudri raziallahu anhu riwayat karte hain ke maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Tum mein se jisne bhi munkar dekha to usko apne haath se taghayyur kare, agar is ki taqat na ho to zabaan se, agar is ki bhi taqat na ho to dil se, aur yeh sab se zaeef imaan hai. [Isey Muslim ne riwayat kiya]."
"35","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah raziallahu anhu riwayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ek dusre se hasad na karo, naajas na karo, ek dusre se nafrat na karo, ek dusre ka muh na phero, aur tum mein se koi doosre ki sai (kharidari) par apni sai na kare, aur Allah ke banday bhai bhai bano. Muslim bhai bhai hai, us par zulm na karo, uski na-uqoofi na karo, usko jhoota na theharao, aur uski tahqir na karo. Taqwa yahan hai, aur Aap teen baar apne seene ki taraf ishara farmate hain. Insaan ke liye yeh kafi shar hai ke apne bhai Muslim ki tahqir kare. Har Muslim par har Muslim haraam hai: uska khoon, uska maal, aur uski izzat. [Isey Muslim ne riwayat kiya]."
"36","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah radiyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jisne ek momin ko duniya ki kurbaton mein se ek kurba door kiya, Allah usay qayamat ki kurbaton mein se ek kurba door karega. Aur jisne mo'assir par aasani ki, Allah uspar duniya aur aakhirat mein aasani karega. Aur jisne musalman ki poshish ki, Allah uski poshish duniya aur aakhirat mein karega. Allah us banday ki madad mein rehta hai jab tak woh bandah apne bhai ki madad mein rehta hai. Aur jisne ilm ki talab mein kisi raah par chala, Allah uske liye us raah ki waja se jannat ki raah aasan kar dega. Aur koi qaum Allah ke kisi ghar mein jama ho kar Allah ki kitab parhti hai aur aapas mein us par mutala'a karti hai, to un par sakinat naazil hoti hi hai, aur rehmat unhein dhaank leti hai, aur farishtey unhein gher lete hain, aur Allah unka zikr apne yahan walon mein karta hai. Aur jisay uske amal ne peeche chhor diya, usay uska nasb aage nahi le ja sakta. [Isay Muslim ne is lafz se riwayat kiya hai.]"
"37","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn-e-Abbas radiyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne Rabb tabaraka wa ta'ala se riwayat karte hue farmate hain: Allah Ta'ala ne nekiyan aur buraiyan likh di hain phir usay beyan kar diya. Pas jisne kisi neki ka irada kiya aur usay anjam na diya, Allah ne usay apne yahan ek mukammal neki likh di. Aur agar usne irada kiya aur amal bhi kiya, to Allah ne usay apne yahan das nekiyan se saat so darja tak aur kayi izafon tak likh di. Aur jisne kisi burai ka irada kiya aur usay anjam na diya, Allah ne usay apne yahan ek mukammal neki likh di. Aur agar usne irada kiya aur anjam bhi diya, to Allah ne usay ek burai likh di. [Isay Bukhari aur Muslim ne apni sahihein mein in lafzon se riwayat kiya hai.]"
"38","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah radiyallahu anhu farmate hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Jisne mere kisi wali ki dushmani ki, usne mujh se jang ka e'lan kar diya. Aur mera bandah aisi kisi cheez se zyada mere qurb ke zariye mujhe pasand nahi karta jo maine us par farz ki hai. Aur mera bandah nawafil ke zariye mere qurb haasil karta rehta hai yahan tak ke main usay mohabbat karne laga hoon. Phir jab main usay mohabbat karne laga hoon to main uska kaan ban jata hoon jis se woh sunta hai, aur uski aankh ban jata hoon jis se woh dekhta hai, aur uska haath ban jata hoon jis se woh pakarta hai, aur uska paaw ban jata hoon jis se woh chalta hai. Aur agar woh mujh se maange to main zaroor dunga, aur agar woh meri panah maange to main usay zaroor panah dunga. [Riwayat-e-Bukhari]."
"39","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn-e-Abbas radiyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne meri ummat ki khata, bhool aur jabray ke amal ko maaf kar diya hai. Yeh hadith-e-Hasan hai, isay Ibn-e-Majah [raqm: 2045] aur Baihaqi [""Sunan"" 7] ne riwayat kiya hai."
"40","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn-e-Umar radiyallahu anhuma farmate hain ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mere kandhe ko pakar kar farmaya: Duniya mein aise ho jaise koi ghareeb ya raah guzar. Aur Ibn-e-Umar radiyallahu anhuma farmate thay: Agar shaam ho jaye to subah ka intezar na karo, aur agar subah ho jaye to shaam ka intezar na karo. Apni sehat se apni bemari ke liye (kuch) lo, aur apni zindagi se apni maut ke liye. [Riwayat-e-Bukhari]."
"41","[AI-translation] Abu Muhammad Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas radi Allahu anhuma se riwayat hai, kehte hain ke farmaya Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: ""Tum mein se koi shakhs tab tak mumin nahi hoga jab tak uski khwahish us cheez ki tabedari mein na ho jo mein le kar aaya hoon."" Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai, humne ise ""Kitab-ul-Hujjah"" mein sahih sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai."
"42","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik radi Allahu anhu se riwayat hai, kehte hain: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: ""Ae ibn-e-Adam! Tu mujhe pukarta aur mujh se ummeed rakhta rahe toh jo kuch tere se guzri mein tujhe maaf kar dunga aur mujhe koi parwah nahi. Ae ibn-e-Adam! Agar tere gunah aasman ki unchaai tak pohnch jayen phir tu mujh se istighfar kare toh mein tujhe maaf kar dunga. Ae ibn-e-Adam! Agar tu zameen bhar ke qarib khataon ke sath mere paas aaye phir aisi haalat mein mere saamne haazir ho ke meri koi shirkat na karta ho, toh mein tere paas zameen bhar ke qarib magfirat lekar aaunga."" Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya hai [Raqam: 3540], aur farmaya: Hadith hasan sahih hai."
